<h2>MQ Data Access Request – Uses subject to Authorisation and License</h2>

<p>The following user has submitted an MQ data access form selecting "Uses subject to Authorisation and License".</p>

<h3>User details</h3>
<p><strong>Email:</strong> <%= @data[:email] %></p>
<p><strong>Forename:</strong> <%= @data[:forename] %></p>
<p><strong>Surname:</strong> <%= @data[:surname] %></p>
<p><strong>Organisation:</strong> <%= @data[:organisation] %></p>

<h3>Use case details</h3>
<p><strong>Organisation Type:</strong> <%= @data[:organisation_type] %></p>
<% if @data[:asset_owner_type].present? %>
  <p><strong>Asset Owner Type:</strong> <%= @data[:asset_owner_type] %></p>
<% end %>
<% if @data[:organisation_type_other].present? %>
  <p><strong>Organisation Type (Other):</strong> <%= @data[:organisation_type_other] %></p>
<% end %>
<p><strong>Use Case:</strong> <%= @data[:use_case] %></p>
<p><strong>Description of Use Case:</strong></p>
<p><%= @data[:use_case_description] %></p>

<h3>Self-attestation</h3>
<p><strong><%= @data[:self_attestation] %></strong></p>

